<title>USA: USDA says weekly export sales report out Friday.</title>
<headline>USDA says weekly export sales report out Friday.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department said it will release its weekly export sales report on Friday, Jan. 3 at 0830 EST/1330 GMT.</p>
<p>USDA normally issues the report on U.S. export sales of grains, oilseeds and products on Thursday and said it would be delayed a day because of the New Year's holiday.</p>
